<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>Decoration1</name>
    <id>64</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>Familiarize yourself with the protocol of canceled adjustments, if necessary, correct the plan lines and clear the list of adjustments&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>پروتکل تعدیلات لغوشده را مطالعه کنید، در صورت لزوم سطرهای برنامه را اصلاح کرده و فهرست تعدیلات را پاک کنید&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>Ознакомьтесь с протоколом отменных корректировок, при необходимости скорректируйте строки плана и очистите список корректировок&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>İptal edilen düzeltmeler protokollerini okuyun, gerekirse plan satırlarını düzeltin ve düzeltmeler listesini temizleyin&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>Hãy tham khảo giao thức điều chỉnh bị hủy, nếu cần thiết, hãy điều chỉnh các dòng kế hoạch và xóa danh sách điều chỉnh&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>Familiarize yourself with the protocol of canceled adjustments, if necessary, correct the plan lines and clear the list of adjustments&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>&lt;img 0:ea868745-71fc-483c-aa6e-f242c06c673f/>&lt;fontsize 10> &lt;/>&lt;fontsize 10>Familiarize yourself with the protocol of canceled adjustments, if necessary, correct the plan lines and clear the list of adjustments&lt;/></value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>Decoration1ExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>66</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
